  itemName: 'Torn log page '
  itemIcon: {fileID: 0}
  descriptionSprite: {fileID: 0}
  description: "A page where it says: \"I can\u2019t wait anymore and just leave
    the days gone by. It\u2019s as if my reason for moving forward had been taken
    away from me... You understand me and I know it, this ordeal brings us together.
    I refuse to stay shut away at home, I refuse to be passive, I have to say goodbye
    to him.   -See you soon, my love, I\u2019ll be back soon. [signature] \""
